{"audio": "hebrews-01.opus", "duration_ms": 117975, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2080, "end_ms": 3340, "text": "Hebrews, Chapter One."}, {"start_ms": 4681, "end_ms": 10361, "text": "On many past occasions and in many different ways, God spoke to our fathers through the prophets."}, {"start_ms": 11001, "end_ms": 18122, "text": "But in these last days He has spoken to us by His Son, whom He appointed heir of all things, and through whom He made the universe."}, {"start_ms": 19022, "end_ms": 26563, "text": "The Son is the radiance of God’s glory and the exact representation of His nature, upholding all things by His powerful word."}, {"start_ms": 27443, "end_ms": 33364, "text": "After He had provided purification for sins, He sat down at the right hand of the Majesty on high."}, {"start_ms": 34024, "end_ms": 40125, "text": "So He became as far superior to the angels as the name He has inherited is excellent beyond theirs."}, {"start_ms": 40905, "end_ms": 46466, "text": "For to which of the angels did God ever say: “You are My Son; today I have become Your Father”?"}, {"start_ms": 46986, "end_ms": 50486, "text": "Or again: “I will be His Father, and He will be My Son”?"}, {"start_ms": 51247, "end_ms": 68649, "text": "And again, when God brings His firstborn into the world, He says: “Let all God’s angels worship Him.” Now about the angels He says: “He makes His angels winds, His servants flames of fire.” But about the Son He says: “Your throne, O God,"}, {"start_ms": 68809, "end_ms": 73109, "text": "endures forever and ever, and justice is the scepter of Your kingdom."}, {"start_ms": 73729, "end_ms": 87171, "text": "You have loved righteousness and hated wickedness; therefore God, Your God, has anointed You above Your companions with the oil of joy.” And: “In the beginning, O Lord, You laid the foundations of the earth,"}, {"start_ms": 87351, "end_ms": 89511, "text": "and the heavens are the work of Your hands."}, {"start_ms": 90191, "end_ms": 94732, "text": "They will perish, but You remain; they will all wear out like a garment."}, {"start_ms": 95392, "end_ms": 110994, "text": "You will roll them up like a robe; like a garment they will be changed; but You remain the same, and Your years will never end.” Yet to which of the angels did God ever say: “Sit at My right hand until I make Your enemies a footstool for Your feet”?"}, {"start_ms": 112054, "end_ms": 116615, "text": "Are not the angels ministering spirits sent to serve those who will inherit salvation?"}], "words": [{"t": "Hebrews,", "s": 2080, "e": 2540, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2760, "e": 3060, "si": 0}, {"t": "One.", "s": 3180, "e": 3340, "si": 0}, {"t": "On", "s": 4681, "e": 4781, "si": 1}, {"t": "many", "s": 4861, "e": 5061, "si": 1}, {"t": "past", "s": 5181, "e": 5461, "si": 1}, {"t": "occasions", "s": 5521, "e": 6121, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 6241, "e": 6381, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 6421, "e": 6501, "si": 1}, {"t": "many", "s": 6561, "e": 6741, "si": 1}, {"t": "different", "s": 6861, "e": 7201, "si": 1}, {"t": "ways,", "s": 7241, "e": 7621, "si": 1}, {"t": "God", "s": 7961, "e": 8221, "si": 1}, {"t": "spoke", "s": 8301, "e": 8581, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 8601, "e": 8661, "si": 1}, {"t": "our", "s": 8761, "e": 8881, "si": 1}, {"t": "fathers", "s": 8921, "e": 9381, "si": 1}, {"t": "through", "s": 9501, "e": 9721, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 9721, "e": 9801, "si": 1}, {"t": "prophets.", "s": 9861, "e": 10361, "si": 1}, {"t": "But", "s": 11001, "e": 11121, "si": 2}, {"t": "in", "s": 11181, "e": 11241, "si": 2}, {"t": "these", "s": 11261, "e": 11501, "si": 2}, {"t": "last", "s": 11561, "e": 11862, "si": 2}, {"t": "days", "s": 11902, "e": 12222, "si": 2}, {"t": "He", "s": 12282, "e": 12342, "si": 2}, {"t": "has", "s": 12402, "e": 12502, "si": 2}, {"t": "spoken", "s": 12562, "e": 12902, "si": 2}, {"t": "to", "s": 12962, "e": 13042, "si": 2}, {"t": "us", "s": 13122, "e": 13242, "si": 2}, {"t": "by", "s": 13322, "e": 13462, "si": 2}, {"t": "His", "s": 13502, "e"